 -- and many similar images -- is that lighter clouds are typically higher up than darker ones. Pictured, light clouds swirl around reddish regions toward the lower right, while they appear to cover over some darker domains on the upper right. The featured image was taken by the robotic Juno spacecraft in 2018 during its 14th low pass over Jupiter. Juno continues in its looping elliptical orbit, swooping near the huge planet every 33 days and exploring a slightly different sector each time around.","img":"https://assets.science.nasa.gov/dynamicimage/assets/science/cds/apod/apod/2026/november/JupiterSwirls_JunoBrealey_3709.jpg?w=1400&fit=clip","by":"NASA, Juno, SwRI, MSSS; Processing & License : Matt Brealey, Seán Doran","video":false},"tle":["1 25544U 98067A   26325.84919917  .00010277  00000+0  19075-3 0  9997","2 25544  51.6320 239.8703 0007384  51.4158 308.7491 15.49540305596195"],"passes":[{"start":"2026-11-22T16:48:07Z","end":"2026-11-22T16:54:49Z","top":"2026-11-22T16:51:28Z","max":84,"from":["W","西"],"to":["E","東"],"mins":7},{"start":"2026-11-22T18:24:55Z","end":"2026-11-22T18:27:44Z","top":"2026-11-22T18:28:15Z","max":81,"from":["W","西"],"to":["W","西"],"mins":3},{"start":"2026-11-23T17:36:56Z","end":"2026-11-23T17:41:31Z","top":"2026-11-23T17:40:17Z","max":90,"from":["W","西"],"to":["E","東"],"mins":5},{"start":"2026-11-23T19:13:45Z","end":"2026-11-23T19:14:27Z","top":"2026-11-23T19:16:55Z","max":41,"from":["W","西"],"to":["W","西"],"mins":1},{"start":"2026-11-24T16:48:56Z","end":"2026-11-24T16:55:38Z","top":"2026-11-24T16:52:16Z","max":87,"from":["W","西"],"to":["E","東"],"mins":7},{"start":"2026-11-24T18:25:43Z","end":"2026-11-24T18:28:38Z","top":"2026-11-24T18:29:00Z","max":55,"from":["W","西"],"to":["SW","西南"],"mins":3},{"start":"2026-11-25T17:37:41Z","end":"2026-11-25T17:42:30Z","top":"2026-11-25T17:41:01Z","max":69,"from":["W","西"],"to":["SE","東南"],"mins":5},{"start":"2026-11-25T19:14:45Z","end":"2026-11-25T19:15:28Z","top":"2026-11-25T19:17:26Z","max":22,"fr